{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y为了突出重点压缩了部分心理因果，尤其S06没有充分呈现他不再用受过的委屈压住想念这一转变，S07也弱化了他逐渐找不回当初决心的过程。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词加亮、话与感受交替、感受随音乐进程出现，让我在听琴时更容易扫到每段核心，也更容易感知情绪从焦躁、怀念到失落、挣扎、重新站稳的细微变化。X的心理叙述更完整，解释人物为什么这样想、为什么发生转变时更充分，但右侧感受容易成为一堆需要自行归类的短词。作为普通观众，我更愿意选Y，因为它把故事重点和音乐体验结合得更直接，同时没有丢掉整条情感主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b73c09de-7f30-48a3-9316-c1868316f97b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T165828401384Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.843, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:59:22.263231+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "af51905d432a95ca625e69e208095a474f09027b153c49db6ec42a06ccf8b072", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt